            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Tarpeh, W. A., Wald, I., Wiprachtiger, M., and Nelson, K. L. (2018). Effects of operating and design parameters on ion exchange columns for nutrient recovery from urine. Environmental Science-Water Research & Technology, 4(6), 828-838. http://doi.org/10.1039/c7ew00478h",
            "type": "citation/reference",
